# Docker ignore file for backend
# Files and directories that should not be copied to the container

# Git
**/.git
**/.gitignore

# IDE
**/.classpath
**/.project
**/.settings
**/.toolstarget
**/.vs
**/.vscode
**/*.*proj.user
**/*.dbmdl
**/*.jfm

# Environment files (use Docker environment variables instead)
**/.env
**/.env.*

# Dependencies (installed during build)
**/node_modules

# Build artifacts (created during Docker build)
**/dist
**/build

# Docker files
**/.dockerignore
**/docker-compose*
**/compose.y*ml
**/Dockerfile*

# Development files
**/npm-debug.log
**/secrets.dev.yaml
**/values.dev.yaml
**/.next
**/.cache
**/charts
**/obj

# Documentation
LICENSE
README.md
*.md

